// One saga notion (DESIGN.md AB35): each operation's transaction-bound writes are the steps of a
// workflow (tx_<SEFF>, Workflow.transactional) with the event sagas' coordination options.
// Effect steps (DESIGN.md AB37): every write of another class and every event reaction is an
