// Failures (O2) as the unified project (H9): changeFailureRate 0.1, restored in 1 h; the system
// has 832 releases a year (the unified project's 16 x 52, F11), shared by the classes in
// proportion to their domain operations (AB24.1); processUnavailability 2e-4 ('deploy');
// tenantShare 1.0: a tenant's failed release or runaway query takes the shared database server
// down for every tenant (U1); asyncWeight 1: a failed asynchronous unit of work (event handlers,
// saga steps) counts as a failed session times its process's criticality (domain
// Process.criticality; copy maintenance 0; AB24.2, AB25).
reliability : Reliability {
    changeFailureRate     = 0.1
    restoreHours          = 1.0
    periodHours           = 8760.0
    processUnavailability = 0.0002
    serverUnavailability  = 0.0001
    tenantShare           = 1.0
    asyncWeight           = 1.0
}

